From: Code and Solder <codeandsolder@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] net: pcs: qcom-ipq9574: test full PCS calibration at first link-up

IPQ5332 MPPE occasionally reports carrier-up but receives zero MAC frames
when QCA8081 copper link is down during the first PCS configuration and
only becomes active on the second PHY poll (~one second later). Toggling
the QCA8081 SerDes FIFO is not necessary for the failure.

For an isolated A/B experiment, perform the full PCS mode configuration
again at the first established SGMII link, before the normal PCS adapter
reset and MAC link-up. Reapply the SGMII in-band/force setting afterwards.
Do not change behavior of other interfaces or subsequent link transitions.

This is an experiment, not a confirmed fix.

Signed-off-by: Code and Solder <codeandsolder@gmail.com>
---
--- a/drivers/net/pcs/pcs-qcom-ipq9574.c
+++ b/drivers/net/pcs/pcs-qcom-ipq9574.c
@@ -157,6 +157,7 @@
 	u8 diag_configs;
 	u8 diag_states;
 	u8 diag_link_ups;
+	bool first_link_mode_restarted;
 };
 
 /* PCS private data */
@@ -985,6 +986,34 @@
 			 speed, duplex, neg_mode);
 	}
 
+	/* Diagnostic A/B: the first mode configuration may complete before
+	 * the external PHY reports copper link. Re-run full PCS calibration,
+	 * now with the PHY linked, to test whether the initial initialization
+	 * sequence leaves the SGMII receive datapath unready. Do this once
+	 * per first SGMII link-up on IPQ5332 MPPE only. Retain the existing
+	 * adapter reset and MAC link-up sequence below.
+	 */
+	if (qpcs->mppe && index == 0 &&
+	    interface == PHY_INTERFACE_MODE_SGMII &&
+	    !qpcs_mii->first_link_mode_restarted) {
+		qpcs_mii->first_link_mode_restarted = true;
+		dev_info(qpcs->dev,
+			 "wave7-diag: pcs first-link-mode-restart begin interface=%s\n",
+			 phy_modes(interface));
+
+		ret = ipq_pcs_config_mode(qpcs, interface);
+		if (ret)
+			goto err_first_link_restart;
+
+		/* Reapply force/in-band mode after full PCS initialization. */
+		ret = ipq_pcs_config_sgmii(qpcs, index, neg_mode, interface);
+		if (ret)
+			goto err_first_link_restart;
+
+		dev_info(qpcs->dev,
+			 "wave7-diag: pcs first-link-mode-restart done\n");
+	}
+
 	switch (interface) {
 	case PHY_INTERFACE_MODE_SGMII:
 	case PHY_INTERFACE_MODE_QSGMII:
@@ -1015,6 +1044,11 @@
 	if (ret)
 		dev_err(qpcs->dev, "PCS link up fail for interface %s\n",
 			phy_modes(interface));
+	return;
+
+err_first_link_restart:
+	dev_err(qpcs->dev,
+		"wave7-diag: pcs first-link-mode-restart failed: %d\n", ret);
 }
 
 static const struct phylink_pcs_ops ipq_pcs_phylink_ops = {
